rockchip-vaapi (1.0.5-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix video freeze (image static, audio continues) caused by three bugs:
    - do_h264_decode: broke after first MPP output frame without checking if
      it was the render_target; with H.264 B-frames this caused 2s timeouts.
      Now drains until render_target.decoded, mirroring do_generic_decode.
    - do_generic_decode FIFO: advancing dq_head past non-head PTS matches
      orphaned earlier surfaces, causing 2s SyncSurface timeouts per frame.
      Now only advances head when matched surface is at the front.
    - CreateContext: MPP blocking decode_get_frame stalled Firefox's GPU
      thread causing full process hangs. Now sets MPP_SET_OUTPUT_BLOCK=0.

